        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/0ec91084db912536b83793e1d4709b02.poster.avif?t=1761661317\" width=800 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/0ec91084db912536b83793e1d4709b02.webm?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/0ec91084db912536b83793e1d4709b02.mp4?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/ee9f4f2714fe2d5111a1a5b12e86c53a.poster.avif?t=1761661317\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/ee9f4f2714fe2d5111a1a5b12e86c53a.webm?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/ee9f4f2714fe2d5111a1a5b12e86c53a.mp4?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Piece by piece you will reveal the truth about what’s really going on. Why are the captain and crewmates missing? What is your role? Who <i>are</i> you, even?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending so long in cryo-sleep can certainly mess with your head…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Or does it?</i> Yeah, no, it definitely does.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And being all alone in an isolated environment can certainly mess with your head…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Or does it?</i> Nahhh, yeah, you're probably fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But stay vigilant. The safety of Starship StellarCrest and your own sanity depend on it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/c295b09f77f3106a70a1824438a3173b.poster.avif?t=1761661317\" width=800 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/c295b09f77f3106a70a1824438a3173b.webm?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/c295b09f77f3106a70a1824438a3173b.mp4?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/b1ab03c855a2dc076772c385bee1bd5a.poster.avif?t=1761661317\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/b1ab03c855a2dc076772c385bee1bd5a.webm?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/b1ab03c855a2dc076772c385bee1bd5a.mp4?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To figure out layered puzzles, you have to bring your A-game. Anticipate  a wide variety of puzzle types that require deduction, pattern recognition, and good ol’ fashion 'out-of-the-box thinking'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze hints to locate keys and their respective lockboxes. But inside one lockbox, you may just find another. And another... A sort of ‘Russian nesting doll’ of lockboxes, if you will. And outside all of those lockboxes, you may discover that <i>you've actually been inside a lockbox the entire time.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So your 'out-of-the-box thinking’ may actually need to be at least several boxes deep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/f53d1b8f45d9c4764e6d117a5bda2420.poster.avif?t=1761661317\" width=800 height=40 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/f53d1b8f45d9c4764e6d117a5bda2420.webm?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/f53d1b8f45d9c4764e6d117a5bda2420.mp4?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/0cbbe895bfc369aa744238824c851861.poster.avif?t=1761661317\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/0cbbe895bfc369aa744238824c851861.webm?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642990/extras/0cbbe895bfc369aa744238824c851861.mp4?t=1761661317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the turns and twists of an atmospheric environment to determine where to venture next.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse forth and back to figure out what details are important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peek into every cranny and nook to unveil hidden secrets that are off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resolve the emergency. Escape the rooms. Question everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this current version of Early Access, you can expect 2-5 hours of playtime (depending on your puzzle-solving abilities and desire to explore).</p>",
